{
    "title": "AirPlay : Screen Cast",
    "description": "AirPlay cast Screen with Apple Air Play for Android. Smart mirror your phone screen in 4k quality with Apple AirPlay technology. With AirPlay TV Screen Mirroring for Android, you can mirror your phone's screen and cast films, games, music, and photos.\r\n\r\nWith the help of a AirPlay TV: Screen Mirroring app, you may screen mirror your phone and tablet to TV fast and steadily. You can quickly airplay movies from your smartphone to a bigger TV screen for an immersive viewing experience. Using Apple AirPlay technology, you can easily mirror and display the content of your Android phone or tablet on a smart TV.\r\n\r\nThe AirPlay application also provides smart control that can support all TV devices such as Samsung, Sony, LG, Roku, Vizio, Hisense, TCL, Chromecast,... so you can control all TVs with just one smartphone.\r\n\r\nThis application enables you to easily stream movies from your mobile device to a larger TV screen, providing you with an immersive viewing experience. With this app, you can conveniently mirror and display the contents of your Android phone or tablet on a smart TV using Apple AirPlay technology.\r\n\r\nCharacteristics\r\n\r\n+ Support for Multiple Devices with AirPlay and Miracast\r\n+ AirPlay to TV for the finest video and movie viewing experience.\r\n+ AirPlay videos, images & files to your smart TV.\r\n+ AirPlay connection with just one tap\r\n+ Quick and easy connection with one tap\r\n+ Quick and simple to screen-mirroring\r\n+ Screen Mirroring phone to large TV more quickly.\r\n+ Cast to TV for the finest video and movie viewing experience.\r\n+ Play smartphone games on your television by screen-mirroring with Miracast & AirPlay\r\n+ Play mobile games on your TV by screen-mirroring with AirPlay\r\n+ Web browser live video casting.\r\n+ Quick access to your favorite apps and channels.\r\n+ Quick connectivity and user-friendly with AirPlay\r\n+ High speed airplay & screen mirroring\r\n+ Web browser live video casting.\r\n+ High speed screen mirroring\r\n+ Quick and simple to screen-mirroring\r\n+ Screen Mirroring phone to large TV in 4K quality.\r\n\r\nLooking for a free app that will allow you to use AirPlay to screen mirror to any TV device? Then you should try out Apple AirPlay TV Screen Mirroring\r\n\r\nSteps to use :\r\n\r\n1. Your smart TV should support Wireless Display or any sort of Display Dongles.\r\n\r\n2. The TV must be connected to the WI-FI network just like your phone.\r\n\r\n3. Search for your Device.\r\n\r\n4. Select and pair the device.\r\n\r\nBefore you start ; The TV needs to be connected to the same WiFi network as your phone . make sure that the device's VPN is turned off.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: This app is not affiliated with Roku, TCL, Samsung, LG, Vizio...or any other trademark mentioned here.",
